Subject: [PATCH] models: expose Metis16 virtual decoder layers

---
 src/models/metis16.cpp | 275 +++++++++++++++++++++++------------------
 src/models/models.h    |  10 ++
 2 files changed, 167 insertions(+), 118 deletions(-)

